        <mxCell id="n6" value="What this phase implements::
the bench generates and transmits messages; the V2X ECU receives,
decodes and forwards them. The ADA node runs the Phase 0 connectivity
tool as a listener so that arrival can be observed; its production code
is Phase 2. The IVI node keeps the supplied artifact and receives nothing." style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;fillColor=#f2f4f9;strokeColor=#e3e5ea;fontColor=#3d3d46;fontSize=15.4;align=left;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="350" width="700" height="118" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
